<title>USA: Melville Corp October same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Melville Corp October same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>WOONSOCKET, R.I. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $432.8     $376.0     +15.1	+11.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $4,410.0   $3,860.0     +14.1	+10.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is 4 weeks ended October 26.</p>
<p>Figures measure results at CVS, its only continuing operation.</p>
</text>
